{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1409592-new-dark-ages-podcast","id":1409592,"title":"New Dark Ages podcast","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-21T11:06:29-07:00","id":1409592,"title":"New Dark Ages podcast","content":"Greetings,<br /> along with a friend, I am making a podcast about the Dark Ages setting. If you want to check it out: <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-06T06:19:36-07:00","id":1412264,"title":"","content":"The latest episode of the World of Dark Ages Podcast is up! This time, we look at the Book of Storyteller's Secrets. Gargoyles, Dragons, Geography!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> In fact, it has been up for 2 days because I made a mistake when scheduling it. Hey, I am new, still learning.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-2-book-of-storyteller-secrets\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/617c1779f0ff5f0824887773/1635522425957/logo+final+256x256.png?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-2-book-of-storyteller-secrets\" target=\"_blank\"> Episode 2: Book of Storyteller Secrets </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-2-book-of-storyteller-secrets\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-2-book-of-storyteller-secrets </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Your friendly, local Vikings take a look at the book that contains secrets only for the Storyteller... or is it! There is fashion tips, musing on city sizes, and magic items! Also a correction: We mention the Viking Buddha as being found on the island of Birka. Actually, it was found on Helg&ouml;, a fe </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-18T11:28:42-07:00","id":1414430,"title":"","content":"Latest episode is up:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-3-constantinople-by-night\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5f5a1ea4b2b1b954b65c2e63/1599741607154/Constantinople_by_Night%252C_role-playing_supplement.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-3-constantinople-by-night\" target=\"_blank\"> Episode 3: Constantinople by Night </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-3-constantinople-by-night\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-3-constantinople-by-night </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In this episode, Jacob gets annoyed by over-powered NPCs and Peter is confused by Viking graffiti artists. So let's dive into Constantinople... by Night. Music: New Hero In Town by Kevin MacLeod Link: https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/5742-new-hero-in-town License: http://creativecommons.org/li </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-24T13:06:29-07:00","id":1415313,"title":"","content":"I've also always thought that the canon Cainite/Kine ratio in DA was 1:1000. But just like you I don't know in which books that's been stated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2198-malkavian87","name":"Malkavian87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2198_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-24T14:09:02-07:00","id":1415324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malkavian87</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1409592-new-dark-ages-podcast?p=1415313#post1415313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've also always thought that the canon Cainite/Kine ratio in DA was 1:1000. But just like you I don't know in which books that's been stated.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <i>Vampire: the Dark Ages</i> core rulebook, 1996: &quot;A city of 10,000 mortals may have a dozen resident vampires, with half a dozen more in the surrounding towns and villages.&quot;<br /> <i>Three Pillars</i>, 1997: &quot;An area can only maintain or conceal the activities of one vampire for every 1001 mortals - a phenomenon referred to as the Rule of 1001 Nights.&quot;<br /> <br /> But it doesn't help that the writers are often really vague as to how big (or small) cities actually are. I believe <i>Constantinople by Night</i> states that the city had a million inhabitants at one point whereas, in reality, it probably didn't surpass 100,000 until the modern era.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-26T00:31:35-07:00","id":1415512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>James_Willoughby</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1409592-new-dark-ages-podcast?p=1415324#post1415324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it doesn't help that the writers are often really vague as to how big (or small) cities actually are. I believe <i>Constantinople by Night</i> states that the city had a million inhabitants at one point whereas, in reality, it probably didn't surpass 100,000 until the modern era.</div> </div> </div> </div>We cover Constantinople's size in our Constantinople episode. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Three Pillars have a list of city sizes which we will talk about when we get to that book.<br /> <br /> Also, thanks for finding the quotes!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T11:32:33-07:00","id":1416499,"title":"","content":"Today is my birthday and all I wish for is for you to listen to the latest episode of the World of Dark Ages Podcast:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-4-clash-of-wills\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5f776ce7bb20ac715bdcb38c/1601662186249/Clash+of+Wills+small.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-4-clash-of-wills\" target=\"_blank\"> Episode 4: Clash of Wills </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-4-clash-of-wills\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-4-clash-of-wills </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Medieval testaments, overpowered NPCs (again), and some audio issues. Is Clash of Wills a good scenario? Let&rsquo;s find out. Music: New Hero In Town by Kevin MacLeod Link: https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/5742-new-hero-in-town License: http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T02:23:08-07:00","id":1418786,"title":"","content":"Latest episode: <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-5-liege-lord-and-lackey\" target=\"_blank\">https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/p...ord-and-lackey</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T11:25:15-07:00","id":1419820,"title":"","content":"We're branching out, so the latest episode is not a look at a book...<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/3-thing-to-know-about-the-middle-ages\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5f8c3deee5c0524b4b818cb7/1603026417328/Side+Quests+small.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/3-thing-to-know-about-the-middle-ages\" target=\"_blank\"> 3 Thing to Know About the Middle Ages </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/3-thing-to-know-about-the-middle-ages\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/3-thing-to-know-about-the-middle-ages </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In the first episode of Side Quests, Peter and Jacob each offer up three relatively unknown facts about the Middle Ages that should be more well-known. Music: New Hero In Town by Kevin MacLeod Link: https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/5742-new-hero-in-town License: http://creativecommons.org/lice </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T12:04:06-07:00","id":1421028,"title":"","content":"So, what ARE the Three Pillars anyway? And did Sweden have any kings in the Middle Ages? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Listen to the latest World of Dark Ages podcast to find out. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-7-three-pillars\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5f940a1f25957a28c1432829/1603537443743/Three+Pillars.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-7-three-pillars\" target=\"_blank\"> Episode 6: Three Pillars </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-7-three-pillars\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-7-three-pillars </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This is about the book Three Pillars. Previously, the description said Clanbook: Cappadocian. That is because Jacob is an idiot. So, have fun with Three Pillars. </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T01:32:07-08:00","id":1422567,"title":"","content":"A new Side Quests is up: <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/3-media-sources-for-inspiration\" target=\"_blank\">https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/p...or-inspiration</a><br /> <br /> Also, we have a Facebook page for questions and comments: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/725170861612795\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/725170861612795</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/