 Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If there's any specific app you use and we're not, lemme know and I'll see about getting on it.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-27T11:03:45-08:00","id":1426338,"title":"","content":"This week, we take a look at the 1st edition Dark Ages Companion and reveal our plans for the 10th episode!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-8-dark-ages-companion\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5fbeb696bc819f1cf4b907b2/1606334105972/DAC.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-8-dark-ages-companion\" target=\"_blank\"> Episode 8: Dark Ages Companion </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-8-dark-ages-companion\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/episode-8-dark-ages-companion </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Combat, Bloodlines, Discplines, Demons, and more! Also, we have something planned for Episode 10. Also, for our 10th Episode, we&rsquo;re doing Q&amp;amp;A. You can submit question on the contact page here, on our Facebook page ( https://www.facebook.com/groups/725170861612795) or on our new Discord ser </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-11T12:32:58-08:00","id":1428115,"title":"","content":"What's your favorite clan; Lasombra, Tzimisce, or Ventrue? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-1-masters-of-the-state\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5fd31ec4ac07166e86656fad/1607671495433/LS1.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-1-masters-of-the-state\" target=\"_blank\"> Libellus Sanguinis 1: Masters of the State </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-1-masters-of-the-state\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-1-masters-of-the-state </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In this episode, we take a look at the first Libellus Sanguinis book, which covers the clans of leadership; Lasombra, Tzimisce, and Ventrue. Also, remember our Q &lsquo;n&rsquo; A for episode 10. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-18T12:43:29-08:00","id":1428901,"title":"","content":"Okay, we are really trying to pander to the base here - an episode about weapons and armor. Come on, you know you love it! <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/arming-a-vampire\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5fdd1213dbadd36d80e6c9a9/1608323605960/Side+Quests+small.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/arming-a-vampire\" target=\"_blank\"> Arming a Vampire </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/arming-a-vampire\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/arming-a-vampire </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> What weapons and armor would a vampire use in the Middle Ages? How would the presence of vampires change weapons and armor? REMEMBER! We are still looking for questions to our Q &lsquo;n&rsquo; A. Music: New Hero In Town by Kevin MacLeod Link: https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/5742-new-hero-in-town </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-08T11:04:10-08:00","id":1431482,"title":"","content":"The World of Dark Ages Podcast is back, this time with a q 'n' a. We also look at Clanbook: Baali. Have you ever used the Baali over even played one? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/clanbook-baali\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/5ff736d04c607e7b17248f5b/1610036946983/images.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/clanbook-baali\" target=\"_blank\"> Clanbook: Baali </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/clanbook-baali\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/clanbook-baali </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In the 10th episode of the World of Dark Ages Podcast, Jacob and Peter answer some listeners' questions and take a look at Clanbook: Baali </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-15T11:30:19-08:00","id":1432327,"title":"","content":"The latest Side Quests from World of Dark Ages Podcast is up. Time to get classic!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/elders-in-dark-ages-1-greece-and-rome\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/6000313724f86130df010699/1610625344464/Side+Quests+small.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/elders-in-dark-ages-1-greece-and-rome\" target=\"_blank\"> Elders in Dark Ages 1: Greece and Rome </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/elders-in-dark-ages-1-greece-and-rome\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/elders-in-dark-ages-1-greece-and-rome </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Going back in time from the Middle Ages, we take a look at what elders from Classical Greece and the Roman Empire would look like in the Dark Ages Setting. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T11:12:39-08:00","id":1433075,"title":"","content":"World of Dark Ages Podcast is back with a new episode. So, Toreador, Tremere, or Brujah, who's your favorite (it's obviously Brujah, but I have to ask).<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-2-keepers-of-the-word\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/600a8b118cb63a3cd379354a/1611303699405/LS2.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-2-keepers-of-the-word\" target=\"_blank\"> Libellus Sanguinis 2: Keepers of the Word </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-2-keepers-of-the-word\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/libellus-sanguinis-2-keepers-of-the-word </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This episode looks at the second of the Libellus Sanguinis books, which focuses on the Toreador, Tremere, and Brujah clans. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T11:02:19-08:00","id":1434625,"title":"","content":"The latest episode of the World of Dark Ages Podcast is up!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/jerusalem-by-night\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/601d0666e1ad967e5f1dce79/1612514920849/02821.jpg?format=1500w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/jerusalem-by-night\" target=\"_blank\"> Jerusalem by Night </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/jerusalem-by-night\" target=\"_blank\"> https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/jerusalem-by-night </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In this episode, we look at one of the holiest cities in history, the focus of both Judaism, Christianity, and Islam. How do Cainites survive in a city of such faith? </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-08T19:25:52-08:00","id":1434901,"title":"","content":"That's actually a lot higher than my opinion of Jerusalem by Night. There are, I think, a whole raft of problems relating to the book, not least due to the fact that it had so many people producing its material (which is why the various chapters don't seem to fit together; the character and history chapters were probably written by different people, for instance). Looks like the character statistics were not provided by the main authors, which is why they are quite peculiar and don't make sense in many instances. And the book has a wafer-thin understanding of Islam and Islamic history, which comes out when they try to define Caliphs or Shi'ism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-18T23:15:03-08:00","id":1435964,"title":"","content":"Due to someone who shall remains namelss (me) pressing Publish rather than Schedule, this week's episode of the World of Dark Ages Podcast is early.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Which gives you more time to ge through or looong ramblings.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/wolves-of-the-sea\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f352e879e84e0597aeaee4d/t/602ecba2621f162fe6a91e5c/